{"type": "mcq", "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Which expression is equivalent to <math alttext=\"2 left parenthesis x minus nine halves right parenthesis left parenthesis x plus 8 right parenthesis\"><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math>?</p>", "keys": ["10244502-4676-4427-8324-a9df4e4fd55c"], "answerOptions": [{"id": "bed5a1c4-df6a-478f-83e8-f2d3cefbd838", "content": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><math alttext=\"2 x squared minus 72\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t<msup>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t</msup>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t<mn>72</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>"}, {"id": "10244502-4676-4427-8324-a9df4e4fd55c", "content": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><math alttext=\"2 x squared plus 7 x minus 72\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t<msup>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t</msup>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mn>7</mn>\n\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t<mn>72</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>"}, {"id": "86fabe97-dec4-4f8b-808c-5ea7cc8bb3c1", "content": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><math alttext=\"2 x squared minus x minus 36\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t<msup>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t</msup>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t<mn>36</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>"}, {"id": "eb19522b-8456-4c4d-9a2d-b5db68947444", "content": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><math alttext=\"x squared plus 7 x minus 36\"><mrow>\n\t<msup>\n\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t</msup>\n\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mn>7</mn>\n\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t<mn>36</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>"}], "rationale": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is correct. In the given expression, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"2 left parenthesis x minus nine halves right parenthesis\"><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>)</mo></math> can be rewritten as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"2 x minus 2 left parenthesis nine halves right parenthesis\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>)</mo></math>, or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"2 x minus 9\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></math>. Applying the distributive property to the expression <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"left parenthesis 2 x minus 9 right parenthesis left parenthesis x plus 8 right parenthesis\"><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>)</mo></math> yields <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"2 x left parenthesis x plus 8 right parenthesis minus 9 left parenthesis x plus 8 right parenthesis\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>)</mo></math>, or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"2 x squared plus 16 x minus 9 x minus 72\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>72</mn></math>. Combining like terms in this expression yields <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"2 x squared plus 7 x minus 72\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>72</mn></math>. Thus, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"2 left parenthesis x minus nine halves right parenthesis left parenthesis x plus 8 right parenthesis\"><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>)</mo></math> is equivalent to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"2 x squared plus 7 x minus 72\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>72</mn></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>", "externalid": "3c39fa3c-f27f-4029-8473-2bb4b3ca5672", "correct_answer": ["B"]}